{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24705","headline":"予与山南王仆射起淮南李仆射绅事历五朝踰三纪海内年辈今唯三人荣路虽殊交情不替聊题长句寄举之公垂二相公 · 白居易","name":"予与山南王仆射起淮南李仆射绅事历五朝踰三纪海内年辈今唯三人荣路虽殊交情不替聊题长句寄举之公垂二相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故交海内只三人，二坐岩廊一卧云。\n老爱诗书还似我，荣兼将相不如君。\n百年胶漆初心在，万里烟霄中路分。\n阿阁鸾凰野田鹤，何人信道旧同羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24705.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24705","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}